# Michelangelo, Mutant BFF: "Each creature you control with a counter on it can't be blocked by more than one creature" (CR
# 509.1b), and "Whenever Michelangelo enters or attacks, create a Mutagen token." He enters with Elvish Mystic (Mutagen #1); a
# Mutagen puts a +1/+1 counter on him; he and the Mystic attack (Mutagen #2). Bot2's two Commandos may not both block the
# countered Michelangelo, while both may block the counterless Mystic.

